works: The hall stands for the great-aunt, and for weeks afterwards people stop {N} in the street to say what a family it is.
works: {grandparent} squeezes {Ns} hand at the end and says the name is in good hands.
fails: The speech stumbles over a name, and an old family quarrel walks back into the room.
